<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Santa Fe Energy signs offshore Ivory Coast deal.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Energy signs offshore Ivory Coast deal.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Ivory Coast and U.S.-based Santa Fe Energy on Monday signed a production-sharing contract for developing offshore oil and gas from block CI-202, the government daily newspaper Fraternite Matin said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal follows an earlier production-sharing agreement between Santa Fe and Ivory Coast in late 1996 for developing a nearby block, CI-24, the paper said.</p>
<p>Local Santa Fe Energy representatives were not immediateley available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom, + 225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
